    "The audit emits catalogue metadata, aggregate candidate counts and boolean postconditions only. It emits no profile identity, phone, Official content, like or comment row values.",
    "The raw replay remains incomplete because the application restore omits required Auth rows; exact remote catalogue state and current DML postconditions provide the exhaustive semantic decision instead.",
    "Six source function bodies remain exact remotely. quata_guard_official_posts is bound to its exact reviewed actor-guard successor; the successor policies and tighter function ACL are additional versioned security semantics.",
    "The later tracked likes, comments and profile RLS migrations are not attributed as remote successors here; current remote state still matches the source baseline for those functions/triggers and source privilege effects.",
    "Current equivalence and postconditions do not establish when the historical migration ran or fabricate a migration-ledger row."
  ]
